  "prefLabel": "Sep 103.04 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 103.04 Organization. Every 2 years, the board shall elect or appoint a chairperson, vice-chairperson, and secretary at the first meeting of the board in a calendar year.\n\nSource. #13791, eff 10-25-23",
